<MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle1" Color="Color.Primary" Class="mt-1 mb-1">Overview</MudText>
<MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
    My Wiki is your personal knowledge base. Entries you add here are used by the AI to produce more
    accurate transcriptions and summaries for your meetings — helping it recognise names, acronyms,
    project codenames, and terminology specific to your work.
</MudText>

<MudDivider Class="my-2" />

<MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle1" Color="Color.Primary" Class="mt-3 mb-1">Adding an entry</MudText>
<MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
    Click <strong>Add Entry</strong> and fill in a <em>Term</em> and a brief <em>Description</em>.
    Good entries to add include:
</MudText>
<ul style="margin: 6px 0 0 18px; padding: 0;">
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2"><li>People's names and roles — <em>"JT — our CFO, John Thompson"</em></li></MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2"><li>Project or product names — <em>"RN — Refuge Notetaker, our meeting intelligence tool"</em></li></MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2"><li>Industry or company acronyms — <em>"E&O — Errors and Omissions insurance"</em></li></MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2"><li>Frequently mentioned vendors or clients</li></MudText>
</ul>

<MudDivider Class="my-2" />

<MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle1" Color="Color.Primary" Class="mt-3 mb-1">Editing and deleting</MudText>
<MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
    Use the <strong>edit</strong> (pencil) icon to update an existing entry, or the <strong>delete</strong>
    (trash) icon to remove it. Changes take effect immediately for new meetings.
</MudText>

<MudDivider Class="my-2" />

<MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle1" Color="Color.Primary" Class="mt-3 mb-1">Privacy</MudText>
<MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
    Your wiki entries are personal — they are only used for your meetings and are not visible to
    other users.
</MudText>

<MudDivider Class="my-2" />

<MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle1" Color="Color.Primary" Class="mt-3 mb-1">Tips</MudText>
<MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
    Keep descriptions concise — a sentence or two is enough. The AI uses these as context clues,
    so clarity matters more than length. You can add entries at any time; they'll apply to all
    future meetings you record.
</MudText>
